      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766229482926,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability: 1M RPS, 100M DAU\n- Latency: Since there will be some latency in terms of the usual API call,\nwe don't want to add additional RL latency on top of it. hence (<10ms)\n- Throughput: high through put should be taken care of. \n- Availability >> consistency \n\n3) Core Entities \n- request \n- rules \n- client \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability: 1M RPS, 100M DAU\n- Latency: Since there will be some latency in terms of the usual API call, we don't want to add additional RL latency on top of it. hence (<10ms)\n- Throughput: high through put should be taken care of. \n- Availability >> consistency \n\n3) Core Entities \n- request \n- rules \n- client \n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
